WEBVTT

00:01:50.600 --> 00:01:53.530
Nice! This is how
battle should be!

00:02:08.566 --> 00:02:12.326
Schneider!
This doesn't concern you!

00:02:12.900 --> 00:02:16.900
Knockout technique!
Fire Crisis!

00:02:17.400 --> 00:02:19.400
Burst Blaze!

00:02:38.766 --> 00:02:41.796
The age of chivalry
ended long ago.

00:02:56.766 --> 00:02:57.766
Mister?

00:03:00.600 --> 00:03:01.770
Mister!

00:03:02.233 --> 00:03:04.873
Mister! Hang in there, Mister!

00:03:06.200 --> 00:03:13.400
Don't cry...on the battlefield.
Don't cry, Shu.

00:03:14.900 --> 00:03:17.300
I'm not crying!

00:03:23.500 --> 00:03:28.400
INFILTRATE!

00:03:47.233 --> 00:03:48.273
Dad!

00:04:18.200 --> 00:04:22.230
Burgers...au gratin...

00:04:34.666 --> 00:04:36.066
Into position, men!

00:04:40.066 --> 00:04:42.826
Alright, men!
Pull them in as far as you can!

00:04:46.800 --> 00:04:48.100
Now! Reverse!

00:04:50.900 --> 00:04:51.570
What?!

00:05:09.133 --> 00:05:10.773
All Knights! Attack again!

00:05:17.400 --> 00:05:18.400
Reporting!

00:05:18.566 --> 00:05:20.896
Our fourth front has infiltrated
the enemy lines by 40 percent.

00:05:21.366 --> 00:05:23.526
And the fifth and sixth fronts
are ready to engage

00:05:23.566 --> 00:05:25.796
as soon as the Francescoli Platoon
is recovered.

00:05:26.666 --> 00:05:27.826
Understood.

00:05:28.400 --> 00:05:29.730
With an attack like this,

00:05:29.766 --> 00:05:32.296
not even the Grankingdom Army
can stand against us for long!

00:05:32.533 --> 00:05:36.203
Keep pressing the attack hard!
And follow me!

00:05:41.533 --> 00:05:44.603
That's the capital of Grankingdom,
The City.

00:05:45.100 --> 00:05:47.570
So that's where the kidnapped
children are being kept.

00:05:48.133 --> 00:05:49.133
Most likely.

00:05:51.733 --> 00:05:55.373
You came here prepared, right?!
You'll die if you're not committed!

00:05:57.066 --> 00:05:59.666
Mister, I'm prepared!

00:06:02.100 --> 00:06:04.100
I'm going to beat you, Nene!

00:06:09.800 --> 00:06:12.030
But, how do we get in?

00:06:17.466 --> 00:06:18.126
Jiro!

00:06:19.133 --> 00:06:20.503
It's a bad habit of yours.

00:06:21.133 --> 00:06:22.273
Don't get emotional.

00:06:22.933 --> 00:06:23.603
Right.

00:06:38.466 --> 00:06:39.466
Damn it!

00:06:48.000 --> 00:06:49.470
Can you wait a minute?

00:06:51.200 --> 00:06:51.870
What is it?

00:06:52.433 --> 00:06:57.173
Well... I was just wondering why
you've been traveling with Zola.

00:06:57.566 --> 00:06:58.566
I told you before.

00:06:58.866 --> 00:07:01.396
The reason why I travel
is to defeat Nene.

00:07:01.800 --> 00:07:02.800
It's that simple.

00:07:02.900 --> 00:07:04.970
Yeah, I remember.

00:07:05.866 --> 00:07:08.066
But isn't your family
worried about you?

00:07:08.500 --> 00:07:09.170
No.

00:07:10.233 --> 00:07:11.373
Because they were killed.

00:07:12.966 --> 00:07:15.826
My dad, my mom,
and my little sister...

00:07:46.900 --> 00:07:48.100
Because of me.

00:07:48.900 --> 00:07:49.600
What?

00:07:49.900 --> 00:07:53.700
In this trip, it's either I get killed,
or I defeat Nene.

00:07:54.333 --> 00:07:55.603
One or the other.

00:07:56.133 --> 00:07:58.873
If I can accomplish that,
I don't care what happens.

00:07:59.900 --> 00:08:02.270
I'm sorry...for being so nosey.

00:08:03.666 --> 00:08:06.766
I've been having dreams...
dreams of the past.

00:08:07.633 --> 00:08:09.433
In them,
I feel peaceful and happy,

00:08:10.333 --> 00:08:12.033
but then suddenly it all
burns down to the ground.

00:08:13.000 --> 00:08:14.000
It's like hell.

00:08:17.500 --> 00:08:19.170
I spoke too much.

00:08:23.600 --> 00:08:24.270
Oh, no!

00:08:24.566 --> 00:08:26.126
We gotta hurry back
to the others!

00:08:26.366 --> 00:08:27.026
Right!

00:08:32.600 --> 00:08:33.270
Zola!

00:08:33.466 --> 00:08:34.126
Zola!

00:08:34.666 --> 00:08:35.326
Over here!

00:08:38.466 --> 00:08:39.526
It's Nene's forces!

00:08:40.033 --> 00:08:40.703
I know.

00:08:41.066 --> 00:08:43.196
Did they figure out
that we're here?

00:08:43.700 --> 00:08:46.730
No, they're not looking for us.

00:08:47.100 --> 00:08:48.800
They're reinforcements
for the front line.

00:08:48.966 --> 00:08:49.626
Huh?

00:08:50.066 --> 00:08:53.426
Jibral and its allies
are engaged in battle

00:08:53.466 --> 00:08:56.096
with the Grankingdom Army
at this very moment.

00:08:56.566 --> 00:08:58.226
It may be quiet here,

00:08:58.266 --> 00:09:00.566
but in the surrounding areas,
war is being waged.

00:09:00.900 --> 00:09:03.770
Nene's attention should be
focusing on that battle right now.

00:09:04.166 --> 00:09:06.266
Our aim lies there.

00:09:29.933 --> 00:09:30.933
Lord Conrad!

00:09:32.500 --> 00:09:34.030
We've got trouble
on the second front.

00:09:34.766 --> 00:09:35.426
What is it?

00:09:35.633 --> 00:09:38.773
After we've reached
the infiltration rate of 78 percent,

00:09:39.233 --> 00:09:41.273
it suddenly started to decline,
and it is currently at 35 percent!

00:09:41.700 --> 00:09:42.830
Is it enemy reinforcements?!

00:09:43.166 --> 00:09:44.296
The details of
the enemy forces unknown.

00:09:44.733 --> 00:09:47.503
Three minutes and twenty seconds ago,
the Vintzot Party had come into contact.

00:09:48.133 --> 00:09:51.073
According to the report,
they could be led by General Logi.

00:09:51.633 --> 00:09:52.303
What?!

00:10:07.833 --> 00:10:08.503
Alright men!

00:10:08.533 --> 00:10:10.603
If we use Type Ones,
we'll have a hole in our formation!

00:10:10.766 --> 00:10:14.566
Get Type Twos to the front lines!
Get Type Ones to logistics support!

00:10:15.000 --> 00:10:15.670
Yes, sir!

00:10:21.633 --> 00:10:23.003
But it's strange.

00:10:23.866 --> 00:10:26.566
Why would Lord Nene move us
closer to the front lines

00:10:26.600 --> 00:10:29.730
immediately after
Dragnov's battle against them?

00:10:32.100 --> 00:10:36.130
It seems as if he's trying to
get me away from them.

00:10:37.800 --> 00:10:39.700
Lord Nene sure is mischievous.

00:10:46.400 --> 00:10:47.400
Reporting, sir.

00:10:47.566 --> 00:10:50.666
General Logi has joined
the fifth army regiment.

00:10:50.833 --> 00:10:52.403
They've already
started to push back.

00:10:52.633 --> 00:10:54.473
Oh, that was quick.

00:10:54.500 --> 00:10:55.800
Quick, quick!

00:10:55.833 --> 00:10:57.773
Now, about Zola
and her team...

00:10:57.800 --> 00:10:59.270
Six of them have
infiltrated the C district.

00:10:59.300 --> 00:11:02.270
It seems they're heading
directly to The City.

00:11:02.300 --> 00:11:03.670
Oh, I see.

00:11:04.566 --> 00:11:06.266
Six rats...

00:11:06.300 --> 00:11:07.970
Rats! Rats!

00:11:08.133 --> 00:11:09.733
What shall we do, sir?

00:11:10.233 --> 00:11:11.503
Let's see.

00:11:11.666 --> 00:11:14.896
Well, I'll leave it up to you.
Do as you will.

00:11:14.933 --> 00:11:16.273
Do it! Do it!

00:11:16.666 --> 00:11:17.326
As you wish.

00:11:28.866 --> 00:11:29.896
Alright, let's go.

00:11:34.400 --> 00:11:37.430
But why are we going
through this place?

00:11:37.600 --> 00:11:40.370
While Nene is focusing
on the battle,

00:11:40.400 --> 00:11:42.200
the castle's security
should be less tight.

00:11:42.600 --> 00:11:44.600
That's why we're using
the drainage canals.

00:11:44.933 --> 00:11:46.733
You should be able to figure it out
if you use your brain a bit.

00:11:46.933 --> 00:11:48.003
So stuck up.

00:11:48.333 --> 00:11:49.433
What?!

00:11:50.666 --> 00:11:52.226
Hey! Stop it!

00:11:53.033 --> 00:11:53.703
Quiet!

00:11:59.833 --> 00:12:00.903
This is such a pain.

00:12:01.133 --> 00:12:03.533
Why don't we just take
those security robots out?!

00:12:03.666 --> 00:12:04.326
Fool!

00:12:04.566 --> 00:12:07.266
If we do that, they're going to
figure out that something is going on!

00:12:07.466 --> 00:12:11.126
Right now, there's something
going on behind me.

00:12:12.700 --> 00:12:15.600
I, I can't bare it any more.

00:12:15.633 --> 00:12:17.133
Nuzzle, nuzzle...

00:12:18.900 --> 00:12:20.100
- Fool!
- Oh, no!

00:12:20.500 --> 00:12:22.470
It's Marumaro's fault!

00:12:22.500 --> 00:12:24.230
It wasn't my fault!

00:12:24.366 --> 00:12:27.526
It's the boobs' fault
for seducing me!

00:12:27.566 --> 00:12:29.826
All right, be quiet already!

00:12:41.433 --> 00:12:45.173
Security unit 21 shut down.
Did the battery run out?

00:12:45.866 --> 00:12:49.326
Whoa! You cut the power
without destroying the robot!

00:12:49.833 --> 00:12:50.503
Let's go.

00:12:54.066 --> 00:12:58.826
The only one who's real trouble is Zola.
The rest is just a bunch of brats.

00:12:59.933 --> 00:13:02.633
Just as I thought,
it's time to use them.

00:13:21.033 --> 00:13:23.873
We've arrived.
This is our destination.

00:13:25.033 --> 00:13:26.703
Nene's castle!

00:13:45.066 --> 00:13:48.726
Hey, how much longer
till we reach Nene?

00:13:50.100 --> 00:13:51.370
Hey! What's the matter?

00:13:51.833 --> 00:13:53.673
O-Oh, right.

00:13:54.300 --> 00:13:54.970
Jiro...

00:13:55.966 --> 00:13:58.326
It really is quiet.

00:13:58.533 --> 00:14:02.273
We haven't run into anyone
in the castle so far.

00:14:02.300 --> 00:14:05.130
Maybe we can get out of here
without seeing anyone.

00:14:05.166 --> 00:14:08.296
But there's no point coming
all the way here if we don't see Nene!

00:14:08.500 --> 00:14:09.700
Oh, right.

00:14:09.766 --> 00:14:10.426
Yeah.

00:14:10.466 --> 00:14:11.796
It is strange.

00:14:23.833 --> 00:14:25.303
What is this place?

00:14:25.533 --> 00:14:27.503
Looks like a huge engine.

00:14:31.566 --> 00:14:33.396
I'm bored.

00:14:33.433 --> 00:14:34.633
Yawn.

00:14:36.400 --> 00:14:37.070
Maro.

00:14:37.266 --> 00:14:38.266
Maro!

00:14:38.300 --> 00:14:39.830
What are you doing?!

00:14:41.000 --> 00:14:44.130
It's opening, it's opening.
It's open!

00:14:55.300 --> 00:14:56.330
What's this place?

00:14:57.033 --> 00:14:58.133
A storage?

00:14:58.166 --> 00:15:00.696
No...seems like
some sort of laboratory.

00:15:02.666 --> 00:15:03.996
Oh!
The entrance!

00:15:06.433 --> 00:15:08.673
Welcome to our laboratory!

00:15:08.966 --> 00:15:12.566
You've finally made it.
I've been waiting for you.

00:15:12.766 --> 00:15:13.926
Who are you!

00:15:14.333 --> 00:15:17.903
I am Lord Nene's right-hand man.
My name is Szabo.

00:15:18.333 --> 00:15:19.003
Nene's?!

00:15:19.500 --> 00:15:20.500
Now I get it.

00:15:20.600 --> 00:15:24.670
The relaxed security inside the canals
and the castle empty of people...

00:15:24.933 --> 00:15:27.233
That was all your doing,
wasn't it?

00:15:27.466 --> 00:15:29.566
You're pretty bright, woman.

00:15:29.833 --> 00:15:33.603
As long as I made it in,
I don't really care about how I got here.

00:15:33.866 --> 00:15:34.866
So thanks for the help.

00:15:34.900 --> 00:15:35.930
Don't thank me.

00:15:36.433 --> 00:15:39.003
In fact, I'm the one who
should be thanking you.

00:15:49.233 --> 00:15:50.233
No!

00:15:50.266 --> 00:15:51.396
You bastard!

00:15:51.600 --> 00:15:55.200
The Shadow-generating machine
that Lord Nene created...

00:15:55.266 --> 00:15:57.526
It drains the power of
the Shadow from humans,

00:15:57.566 --> 00:15:59.796
and uses it to fuel weapons.

00:16:00.133 --> 00:16:02.073
These kids are the power source.

00:16:02.233 --> 00:16:06.573
And you'll become one
as well just like them,

00:16:06.600 --> 00:16:09.730
to provide us with
an inexhaustible source of power!

00:16:09.900 --> 00:16:11.800
Soon this world will be ours!

00:16:12.033 --> 00:16:15.503
We've destroyed cities for this,
and it's finally starting to pay off!

00:16:16.666 --> 00:16:18.866
Do you have any idea
how many people perished?!

00:16:18.900 --> 00:16:22.700
How many cities destroyed?!
For something stupid like that?!

00:16:22.800 --> 00:16:24.670
Hmm...I wonder how many.

00:16:24.700 --> 00:16:25.800
I forgot.

00:16:26.333 --> 00:16:27.833
What did you say?!

00:16:28.166 --> 00:16:30.196
Jiro, stop it! Calm down!

00:16:31.300 --> 00:16:32.300
Muffei!

00:16:32.400 --> 00:16:34.570
Did you forget all about
the town of Muffei, too?!

00:16:35.000 --> 00:16:36.000
Jiro...

00:16:36.900 --> 00:16:39.930
Muffei? Oh, I remember!

00:16:40.133 --> 00:16:44.273
I burned it down myself,
following Lord Nene's orders.

00:16:48.866 --> 00:16:50.326
You bastard!

00:16:50.933 --> 00:16:51.603
Hold it!

00:16:51.866 --> 00:16:52.526
Jiro!

00:16:56.600 --> 00:16:58.530
I'm taking that power!

00:17:09.133 --> 00:17:09.803
Maro!

00:17:10.200 --> 00:17:11.200
Jiro!

00:17:13.000 --> 00:17:14.500
That was too easy!

00:17:14.533 --> 00:17:15.203
Jiro!

00:17:15.933 --> 00:17:17.203
What's going to happen?!

00:17:18.266 --> 00:17:21.126
Hey! Let me out! Let me out!

00:17:21.300 --> 00:17:23.700
It's showtime!

00:17:36.000 --> 00:17:37.000
What?!

00:17:41.600 --> 00:17:43.070
Quite impressive!

00:17:43.100 --> 00:17:45.530
To think your power alone
can operate so many Type Twos!

00:17:46.166 --> 00:17:48.526
Lord Nene will be happy!

00:17:51.100 --> 00:17:52.100
Damn!

00:17:52.500 --> 00:17:56.770
Now, catch the rest and
make them your power supply!

00:18:09.833 --> 00:18:10.933
Let's go!

00:18:22.966 --> 00:18:25.066
Let's take them down,
Blue Dragon!

00:18:26.866 --> 00:18:28.066
Careful, Shu!

00:18:28.533 --> 00:18:29.203
What?

00:18:29.433 --> 00:18:32.903
If we attack that capsule,
Jiro could get caught in the crossfire!

00:18:49.400 --> 00:18:50.470
Fight hand-to-hand!

00:18:59.000 --> 00:18:59.670
Bouquet!

00:18:59.700 --> 00:19:02.430
Can you somehow help
Jiro with your Shadow?

00:19:02.900 --> 00:19:04.900
You're really asking
a lot of me, here!

00:19:05.133 --> 00:19:07.803
In a situation like this,
you've got to disappear or something.

00:19:08.366 --> 00:19:10.226
Oh wait, I should disappear!

00:19:14.700 --> 00:19:17.700
I can take you guys down
with just a flick of my wrist, maro!

00:19:17.900 --> 00:19:21.370
Let's go, Saber Tiger.

00:19:21.400 --> 00:19:23.000
U-Underwear, maro!

00:19:23.800 --> 00:19:25.300
Maro...

00:19:28.166 --> 00:19:29.926
What are you doing?!

00:19:46.300 --> 00:19:47.630
And that just leaves you.

00:19:49.433 --> 00:19:52.533
Let's go! Blue Dragon!

00:20:02.266 --> 00:20:04.926
As long as I have him with me,
you're powerless!

00:20:06.433 --> 00:20:07.633
This is all my fault!

00:20:08.100 --> 00:20:09.600
Damn it.

00:20:10.666 --> 00:20:11.666
Jiro...

00:20:13.866 --> 00:20:17.166
I can't die in a place like this.
Not before I defeat Nene.

00:20:19.066 --> 00:20:23.696
I will get stronger...
to avenge everyone!

00:20:24.000 --> 00:20:27.170
You're the sole survivor
from Muffei, aren't you?

00:20:27.266 --> 00:20:28.526
What does it matter to you?!

00:20:28.766 --> 00:20:33.026
Don't worry, I'll help you
join your friends and family.

00:20:33.266 --> 00:20:34.696
In the afterlife!

00:20:36.466 --> 00:20:39.166
But this is such a strange fate...

00:20:39.333 --> 00:20:40.003
What?!

00:20:40.266 --> 00:20:43.366
Lord Nene ordered me
to burn your town.

00:20:43.700 --> 00:20:46.570
And now I'm the one
laying you to the ground.

00:20:47.366 --> 00:20:50.896
Aren't you glad that
you're not left out?

00:21:00.633 --> 00:21:02.433
Wait! Stop!

00:21:03.000 --> 00:21:04.570
That's too much energy!

00:21:11.233 --> 00:21:13.533
Oww... It's broken.

00:21:13.866 --> 00:21:15.466
Lord Nene is going to be upset.

00:21:26.900 --> 00:21:28.070
Waves of Rage!

00:21:43.833 --> 00:21:44.503
Jiro!

00:21:44.533 --> 00:21:45.203
Jiro!

00:21:46.100 --> 00:21:47.100
Are you ok?

00:21:47.666 --> 00:21:49.626
Yeah. I'm sorry.

00:21:50.666 --> 00:21:52.166
I got too emotional.

00:21:54.833 --> 00:21:56.633
It's just another style of fighting,
that's all.

00:22:01.033 --> 00:22:03.173
But it's not over yet.

00:22:10.900 --> 00:22:13.530
Well, that was quite
an impressive performance.

00:22:14.200 --> 00:22:15.530
Impressive, impressive!

00:22:17.500 --> 00:22:18.500
That power...

00:22:18.533 --> 00:22:21.733
Is it like the power of the legends,
I wonder?

00:22:21.966 --> 00:22:23.296
Wonder, wonder!

00:22:31.200 --> 00:22:34.630
Hello. How do you do.

00:22:34.666 --> 00:22:35.896
This is...

00:22:36.700 --> 00:22:37.700
Nene!

00:24:22.900 --> 00:24:26.430
Right before the final battle,
Shu faces the worst situation.

00:24:26.466 --> 00:24:28.526
I've lost my memory card!

00:24:28.566 --> 00:24:30.696
I'll lend you mine!

00:24:30.733 --> 00:24:33.233
Whoa, thanks!
All right then...huh?

00:24:33.366 --> 00:24:34.366
The final boss is so weak.

00:24:34.400 --> 00:24:38.070
Invincible Kluke, level 99.
All the monsters have been wiped out.

00:24:38.666 --> 00:24:41.196
Next on Blue Dragon:
"Kluke's Feelings."
